        <mxCell id="R9d-7NJiSH4ExI2Srzwc-104" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;woltflow-selenium-image&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Docker image with Chrome, Node, and webdriver installed with the application build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;ECR: serverless-woltflow-server-dev&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chrome version:&amp;nbsp;131.0.6778.204&lt;br&gt;WebDriver version:&amp;nbsp;131.0.6778.204&lt;br&gt;Node version: latest&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Size: 715 MB&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
